{"title":"Macro","sourceTitle":"Macro/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Macro\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Macro (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Macro/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Macro (100% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Macro/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Макросы (10% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Macro/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"宏 (60% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div><p><br />\n</p><p>No Vintage Story, <b>macros</b> são usados ​​para executar rapidamente alguns comandos com um atalho de teclado sem a necessidade de digitá-los na janela de bate-papo.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Criação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Criação</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Recomendações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Recomendações</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Nome\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Nome</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Teclas_de_atalho\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Teclas de atalho</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Creation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Macro_Editor.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/6/65/Macro_Editor.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"363\" height=\"338\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"363\" data-file-height=\"338\" /></a><figcaption>A janela do Editor de Macros.</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Pressione <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r116235\">.mw-parser-output .keyboard-key{border:1px solid #aaa;border-radius:0.2em;box-shadow:0.1em 0.1em 0.2em rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background-color:#f9f9f9;background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#eee,#f9f9f9,#eee);color:#000;padding:0.1em 0.3em;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.85em}.mw-parser-output .nowrap{white-space:nowrap}</style><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">M</kbd> para abrir a janela do Editor de Macro.</li>\n<li>Selecione um ícone para sua macro.</li>\n<li>Dê um nome à sua Macro.</li>\n<li>Escreva uma combinação de atalhos de teclado para a execução de sua macro.</li>\n<li>Escreva um ou vários comandos. Pode ser qualquer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/List_of_server_commands\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/List of server commands\">comando do servidor</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands\" title=\"List of server commands\"> </a></span> ou qualquer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/List_of_client_commands\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/List of client commands\">comando do cliente</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/List_of_client_commands\" title=\"List of client commands\"> </a></span>.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Recommendations\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Recomenda.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recomendações\">Recomendações</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Name\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Nome\">Nome</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Nomeie todas as suas macros com um nome exclusivo.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Hotkeys\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Teclas_de_atalho\">Teclas de atalho</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Insira várias teclas de atalho [Ctrl, Alt, Shift, etc.] + [Qualquer coisa] porque o jogo já possui muitas teclas de atalho que servem a um propósito.</li>\n<li>Se você modificar a tecla de atalho de uma macro já existente, ela não funcionará a menos que você reinicie o jogo.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\">Guias</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Guides| ]]</span> • <a href=\"/Special